00:09:38.516 --> 00:09:39.516
Diam.

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:42.744
Halo?

00:09:44.469 --> 00:09:46.003
Halo?

00:09:47.699 --> 00:09:48.758
Baik.

00:09:48.759 --> 00:09:51.107
Aku akan menganggapnya sebagai ya.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:55.868
Oh.

00:09:56.235 --> 00:09:56.777
Oh.

00:09:56.778 --> 00:09:58.748
Maaf.

00:10:16.967 --> 00:10:18.281
Terima kasih.

00:10:20.891 --> 00:10:21.962
Apa apa sih denganmu?

00:10:22.072 --> 00:10:22.541
Apa?

00:10:22.543 --> 00:10:23.529
Apakah Anda pikir dia akan memembacokku

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:25.148
