untukmu sepanjang malam.

00:11:52.158 --> 00:11:53.158
Serius?

00:11:53.547 --> 00:11:54.594
Apa-apaan ini?

00:11:54.595 --> 00:11:57.110
Ini dia nona-nona.

00:11:57.436 --> 00:11:58.454
Ya.

00:11:58.455 --> 00:11:59.719
Kalian berdua baik-baik saja?

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:00.925
Oh, dia tidak berbahaya.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:02.730
Kau baik-baik saja?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.533
Jangan khawatir, aku akan menjaganya.

00:12:05.534 --> 00:12:06.726
Nikmati pizza Anda.

00:12:21.753 --> 00:12:22.753
Apa yang kau pandangi?

00:12:24.986 --> 00:12:25.986
Tas itu.

00:12:26.248 --> 00:12:27.648
